      "message": "You should be using paths (and dependencies) to the tools used from the source tree or built output, not relying it being in $PATH (which wouldn\u0027t be the case on the build servers, and can cause other issues).\n\nIt is possible for a build rule to make a local addition to PATH so that tools that alway use $PATH for lookups can still function, by doing something like:\n\n  PATH\u003dmy/path:$$PATH path/to/my/script\n\nBut in general I recommend supporting explicit paths so that a variable can be used and the dependencies and used scripts never get out of sync.",
